# Reviewed exceptions to the wording rule for text shown inside the program.
#
# One per line: path | banned word | text
# The exception covers a string literal (or knowledge-table value) in that file
# that has that banned word and contains that text. An exception that matches
# nothing fails the check, so this list cannot go stale.
#
# None are needed today. The product name "Disk Cleanup" is one word and
# passes without an entry; only "clean up" as two words is banned.
